  - m_Id: 462155494588416
    m_Localized: DAILY RATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142848
    m_Localized: '{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142849
    m_Localized: Frame {0} of {1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142850
    m_Localized: A missed day never rewinds the tape
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142851
    m_Localized: The next frame comes tomorrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142852
    m_Localized: CLAIM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142853
    m_Localized: DONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142854
    m_Localized: "\xD7{0} FOR AN AD"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142855
    m_Localized: '{0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 462155528142856
    m_Localized: "\xD7{0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465765972443136
    m_Localized: It's breaking free! Keep it in the ring, don't let go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997568
    m_Localized: AGENT TIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997569
    m_Localized: 'Its trick left it stunned: hit it with the beam now!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997570
    m_Localized: 'Step closer: up close the beam charges much faster.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997571
    m_Localized: 'It''s in the lens: take a photo for its case file.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997572
    m_Localized: 'Cold spot: it is hiding nearby. Walk around the furniture and come
      close.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997573
    m_Localized: 'Don''t move: it will come to you on its own.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997574
    m_Localized: 'Witching hour: rare ghosts come more often and every catch pays
      more.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997575
    m_Localized: Each perk lasts to the end of the shift and stacks with the others.
      Pick for the next ghost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997576
    m_Localized: NEW
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997577
    m_Localized: RESET TIPS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 465766005997578
    m_Localized: TIPS WILL SHOW AGAIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668077995196416
    m_Localized: SPIRIT BOX
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078058110976
    m_Localized: "\u201C{0}\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078058110977
    m_Localized: " \xB7 "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305280
    m_Localized: "\xB7 \xB7 \xB7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305281
    m_Localized: AHEAD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305282
    m_Localized: LEFT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305283
    m_Localized: RIGHT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305284
    m_Localized: BEHIND YOU
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305285
    m_Localized: CLOSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305286
    m_Localized: FAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305287
    m_Localized: HIDING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 668078062305288
    m_Localized: 'The agency issued you a Spirit Box: switch it on and listen. The
      voice tells you where the ghost is.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 674327017422848
    m_Localized: MODE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 674327084531712
    m_Localized: NIGHT VISION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 674327084531713
    m_Localized: 'The agency issued you night vision: tap MODE. You see a faint shape
      of the ghost without revealing it, and it won''t notice you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 678718378213376
    m_Localized: THERMAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 678718466293760
    m_Localized: 'The agency issued you a thermal camera: tap MODE until THERMAL.
      Ghosts show as cold shapes, even behind furniture.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683306913234944
    m_Localized: UV LIGHT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 683307118755840
    m_Localized: 'The agency issued you a UV flashlight: tap MODE until UV LIGHT.
      Glowing ectoplasm shows where the ghost went. Follow the trail.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094043029504
    m_Localized: EVP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094093361152
    m_Localized: "REC \xB7 EVP {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094093361153
    m_Localized: "EVP: \u201C\u2026{0}\u2026\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094093361154
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094093361155
    m_Localized: 'EVP: ONLY STATIC'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094093361156
    m_Localized: 'The agency issued you an EVP recorder: tap EVP near the ghost.
      On the tape its voice says its name, and the recording goes into its case file.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094093361157
    m_Localized: 'EVP on file: its voice on tape. Tap the cassette to listen. Counts
      towards declassification.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 692094093361158
    m_Localized: 'No EVP yet. Record the ghost within {0} m: its voice on tape counts
      as evidence.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086138970112
    m_Localized: PRANK PHOTO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244800
    m_Localized: PRANK PHOTO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244801
    m_Localized: Ghost in the shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244802
    m_Localized: Opens after your first catch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244803
    m_Localized: Point at the floor where the ghost should stand and tap PLACE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244804
    m_Localized: "Drag to move \xB7 two fingers to turn and resize \xB7 then shoot."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244805
    m_Localized: PLACE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244806
    m_Localized: MOVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 698086231244807
    m_Localized: EXIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 704206744190976
    m_Localized: 'BEST TOOL:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 719312148365312
    m_Localized: NIGHT SHIFT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 719312198696960
    m_Localized: '{0} ghosts in a row'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 731142312820736
    m_Localized: Music
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341642911744
    m_Localized: "INCOMING TAPE \xB7 NIGHT BUREAU \xB7 CLASSIFIED"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129472
    m_Localized: 'Agent, welcome. From tonight you work for the Night Bureau.


      We
      have been around since 1987 and we do one thing: we catch what lives in ordinary
      flats and has no right to be there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129473
    m_Localized: 'Your kit is the Hauntscope camera. It sees what the eye cannot,
      and it records everything.


      Its last owner, Agent Ida Vale, vanished
      on the 31st of October in the middle of a case. The camera came back to the
      Bureau on its own. Her tapes are in the archive. Listen to them as they surface:
      she knew more than we do.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129474
    m_Localized: "Your first case is your own flat. The meter shows activity. Find
      it, reveal it, catch it.\n\nAnd, agent\u2026 if the camera ever shows you something
      that is in none of our files, tell me first.\n\n\u2014 The Curator"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129475
    m_Localized: NEXT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129476
    m_Localized: ACCEPT THE CASE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129477
    m_Localized: SKIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129478
    m_Localized: '{0}/{1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129479
    m_Localized: ARCHIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129480
    m_Localized: TAPE ARCHIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129481
    m_Localized: 'Tapes: {0}/{1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129482
    m_Localized: "VALE \xB7 {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129483
    m_Localized: "BUREAU \xB7 00"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129484
    m_Localized: Briefing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129485
    m_Localized: CLOSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129486
    m_Localized: Vale's tapes surface as your cases do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129487
    m_Localized: NEW TAPE IN THE ARCHIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129488
    m_Localized: "{0}: \u201C{1}\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129489
    m_Localized: 'Listen in the menu: ARCHIVE'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129490
    m_Localized: First light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129491
    m_Localized: Opens after your first catch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129492
    m_Localized: 'Tape one. Caught my first tonight: a little light in the bathroom.
      The Curator says they are the easy ones.


      One thing I noticed: the moment
      it sees you, it freezes. Strike then. And mind the battery. The lens eats it
      faster than you think.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129493
    m_Localized: More of them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129494
    m_Localized: Opens after {0} catches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129495
    m_Localized: 'The third this week. The Bureau used to get one call a month. Now
      it is every night. Something is wearing thin, and they get through more easily.


      The
      poltergeist jumps, but after each jump it is dazed for a second. I am learning
      to read them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129496
    m_Localized: The witching hour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129497
    m_Localized: Opens after {0} catches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129498
    m_Localized: 'Between eleven and four they are different. Stronger. And the ones
      you never see by day come out: the one that stands behind you until you turn.


      If
      the floor creaks, turn at once. Do not ask me how I know.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129499
    m_Localized: The seal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129500
    m_Localized: Opens after your first declassified file
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129501
    m_Localized: 'Declassified my first file today. At the end of each one there
      is a paragraph that is not in any training manual.


      I counted the files
      in the archive. There are twelve. But the numbers go up to thirteen. Folder
      thirteen is empty. The Curator says it is a misprint.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129502
    m_Localized: Night shift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129503
    m_Localized: Opens after your first night shift
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129504
    m_Localized: 'Three ghosts in a row, in one flat. That does not happen.


      I
      checked. They were not coming to the address. They were coming to the camera.
      The Hauntscope does not just see them. It calls them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129505
    m_Localized: My name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129506
    m_Localized: Opens after {0} catches
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129507
    m_Localized: 'I left the EVP running overnight to catch the mara. On the tape
      a voice said a name. Mine. And it was my voice.


      I played it again.
      Now there is only static. Tomorrow is the 31st of October. I am taking the
      last call alone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341777129508
    m_Localized: File thirteen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341785518080
    m_Localized: Opens when you have caught {0} different ghosts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 750341785518081
    m_Localized: 'If you can hear this, the camera is working again, and it has a
      new agent. Listen carefully.


      I did not vanish. I am in the tape, between
      the frames. When the silence in a room goes too even, that is me.


      File
      thirteen is mine. Open it. Set me free. Or catch me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4815341336526848
    m_Localized: PREMIUM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4815341386858496
    m_Localized: PREMIUM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4815341386858497
    m_Localized: "\u2014"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4815341386858498
    m_Localized: ENDS IN {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4815341386858499
    m_Localized: '{0}'
    m_Metadata:
